msgctxt "212"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "Che vuoi fare?"

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Oh, you're the guy who helped me in Kamurocho..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Did you seriously come all the way to Okinawa just to\r\n"
"throw the stuff in your backpack into this river?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Wait, what are you talking about, Kiryu-san? What's he\r\n"
"going to throw away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Hirano's backpack is packed full of copies of Shonen Five."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "What!? Is that⑬ Is that true, Hirano-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"You know, no matter how many times you throw your manga\r\n"
"into this river, you won't be able to get over your pain and regret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "How do you know about..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I heard it from your old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Shit... What the hell is happening here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"Hirano-san! You bought all those Shonen Fives, just to\r\n"
"throw them away!? Why!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"So why would you buy so many Shonen Fives, just to throw\r\n"
"them all away!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "He probably didn't want his dad to know about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "His dad might've recognized his manga in the magazine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"That's why he bought all the copies of Shonen Five he\r\n"
"could, to throw them all away at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid ""
"That doesn't make sense... Why would he buy up all the\r\n"
"Shonen Fives in Kamurocho, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "...You've got a point there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Is that right, Hirano-san? You were going to throw away\r\n"
"these magazines to keep your father from finding out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"I mean, yeah, I didn't want my father to know about the\r\n"
"manga thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "But... that's not why I bought them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "He just really hates Shonen Five."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"That's ridiculous! That's not why I'm doing this, not\r\n"
"at all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"It's been my dream to have a series published in Shonen\r\n"
"Five... Why would I ever hate it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "If that's the case, then why are you throwing them away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Beh..."

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Hirano-san, please, tell us! Why!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "No, that's... that's not it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "He's giving up on his dream of being a manga artist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "596"
msgid ""
"Hirano should've been over the moon to win that award.\r\n"
"Instead, he only felt conflicted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid ""
"He thought he had to become a doctor to fulfill his\r\n"
"family's expectations of him and tried to suppress his\r\n"
"desire to go pro with his manga."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Isn't that right, Hirano?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid ""
"So, to get rid of the conflict he was feeling, he bought as\r\n"
"many issues of Shonen Five as he could..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"...and tried to absolve himself of his self-perceived\r\n"
"\"sin\" by throwing them away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid "He thought it was a sin...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"Throwing away something you love so dearly is something\r\n"
"Hirano considers to be a sin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"Because of this \"sin\" of his, he felt he had to force\r\n"
"himself to give up on his dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid ""
"You're right... It's just as you said, Kiryu-san. It's a sin.\r\n"
"I don't have the right to draw manga..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "But why would drawing manga be a sin...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"I don't want to give up on my manga... But I have to, if I'm\r\n"
"going to become a doctor in the future..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Hirano-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "764"
msgid "You don't need to give up on your dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Tsutomu... You don't need to throw your dream away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Dad...?"
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "860"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Tsutomu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"I had no idea you were pushing yourself so hard, you were\r\n"
"lying to people about being from a family of doctors..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Wait... I don't have to give up on my dream? What do you\r\n"
"mean, Dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "You should become a professional manga artist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Dad... But, why...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "920"
msgid ""
"Tsutomu... Do you know why I made you get rid of all your\r\n"
"manga, all those years ago?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "932"
msgid "You wanted me to focus on studying, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid ""
"That was part of it, but to tell you the truth... I was\r\n"
"afraid you'd make the same mistakes that I did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr "Cosa...?"

msgctxt "968"
msgid ""
"The reason I bought you so much manga when you were young...\r\n"
"is because I love manga more than anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "Wait, you do!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"I always wanted to be a manga artist, but I never had the\r\n"
"talent to go pro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"I submitted my work to dozens of manga contests, but I never\r\n"
"won a single award. Hell, the Shonen Five contest was\r\n"
"so out of my league, I never even considered it an option."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr "Papà..."

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Despite that, I kept drawing my manga, to the point of\r\n"
"shirking my studies to become a doctor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid ""
"In the end, I couldn't fulfill either goal... That's how I\r\n"
"ended up inheriting the family pharmacy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid "I didn't want the same thing happening to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Wait, so you mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid "You've got what it takes to be a professional manga artist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"As someone who once dreamed of becoming just that, I know\r\n"
"just how wasteful it would be to throw it all away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
"Wait, so you'll support Tsutomu-san's efforts to become\r\n"
"a manga artist!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid ""
"Of course I will. If Tsutomu wants to be a manga artist...\r\n"
"Then it's my duty as his father to believe in him and give\r\n"
"him all the support he needs."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1124"
msgid "You're an editor for Shonen Five, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "I trust you will help my son down the path he's chosen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Of course, I'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid ""
"This is fantastic, Hirano-san! Now nothing's stopping\r\n"
"you from making the manga you love!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"Let's get right to business and start talking about your\r\n"
"new series! I'm sure it'll be your greatest work yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Dad... Thank you so much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "You've chosen this path. Now give it your all, Tsutomu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"I will. I swear I will... I'll make my debut as an artist in\r\n"
"Shonen Five!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much, Kiryu-san... You've done so much for\r\n"
"my son, and our family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr "Non c'è di che."

msgctxt "1244"
msgid "Um... Here. Have my magazines."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid ""
"The manga I created is in this issue. Please read it,\r\n"
"and show it to everyone you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Received a stack of <Color:8>50 Issues of Shonen Five<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid ""
"Thanks, I will. Good luck with your career, I hear being a\r\n"
"manga artist is pretty tough. Give it your all, both for\r\n"
"yourself and that dad of yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid "You got 10,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "He didn't want his father to know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid "He's giving up on his dream."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
